; claude: the racing kit's 3D half (see docs/claude_notes/plan_games3d.md,
; section 9): a circuit as a closed spline with a width, a height and a
; bank, turned into a ribbon of quads (Track3d). Used by
; TinyMarioKart64; and by TinyVirtuaRacing, whose course stays the Road.t it
; shares with TinyOutRun ([of_road] turns one into a ribbon).
;
; Its own library rather than part of kit_racing next door, because it
; draws: elm_playground_3d is a virtual library, so a 2D game linking
; the racing kit (TinyMicroMachines, TinyMarioKart) would
; have to link a 3D backend too. A private library, not installed.
(library
 (name kit_racing3d)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_playground elm_playground_3d kit_racing)
)
